        a                              ecrm:E8_Acquisition ;
        rdfs:comment                   "This parasol was purchased in Manchester by Mr. Patchett of Bewdley as a present for his betrothed, Miss Maxwell, whose father was the banker of Bewdley. Miss Maxwell was the cousin of the donor's mother. (Information from donor's letter dated 13 December 1914)"@en ;
